{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick &amp; Fun! Side-Scrolling 2D Action Game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 2D action game lets you zip around with over-the-top abilities: teleport, smash from afar, slash up close, and even go invincible! Mix and match to clear stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: D-Pad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump / Warp: B Button</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends\u2019 Abilities: A, X, Y Buttons<br><i>Note: Friends\u2019 abilities are unlocked as you progress through the stages.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Warp&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lulu can warp short distances anytime, anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phase through thin walls, bounce back from falls, and grab coins automatically. Hop on coin rails and zoom around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warping keeps momentum, so slide across the ground or run up walls smoothly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All about <strong>feeling awesome while moving</strong>\u2014dash through the stages like lightning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Friends\u2019 Abilities&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet up with friends during stages to use their cool abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 3 friends can be mapped to A, X, and Y, and you can use them almost endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lulu doesn\u2019t attack herself, so warp smartly and let your friends do the fighting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Chat System&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lulu and friends chat automatically while you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more friends you have, the livelier the conversations get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t stop moving\u2014enjoy lots of banter and maybe even get some handy tips now and then!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102840?t=1760958760","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102840?t=1760958760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102840/028762cc4de0ab8d09d0e71b027875d1930ee3a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760958760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102840/028762cc4de0ab8d09d0e71b027875d1930ee3a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760958760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick &amp; Fun! Side-Scrolling 2D Action Game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 2D action game lets you zip around with over-the-top abilities: teleport, smash from afar, slash up close, and even go invincible! Mix and match to clear stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: D-Pad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump / Warp: B Button</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends\u2019 Abilities: A, X, Y Buttons<br><i>Note: Friends\u2019 abilities are unlocked as you progress through the stages.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Warp&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lulu can warp short distances anytime, anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phase through thin walls, bounce back from falls, and grab coins automatically. Hop on coin rails and zoom around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warping keeps momentum, so slide across the ground or run up walls smoothly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All about <strong>feeling awesome while moving</strong>\u2014dash through the stages like lightning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Friends\u2019 Abilities&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet up with friends during stages to use their cool abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 3 friends can be mapped to A, X, and Y, and you can use them almost endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lulu doesn\u2019t attack herself, so warp smartly and let your friends do the fighting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Chat System&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lulu and friends chat automatically while you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more friends you have, the livelier the conversations get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t stop moving\u2014enjoy lots of banter and maybe even get some handy tips now and then!</p>","developers":["Frien"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102840/645afd3c44995817ab4e1b2be3355dc0d9779e96/header.jpg?t=1760958760","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4102840/1860248254/299e0c314a88f7ddbe8ddf62872b3875437b8319/1760955059/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760956313","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com